Image Organiser
===============

This is the RISC OS application directory.

Click its iconbar icon to open the browser window, or drag a PNG file onto the
icon or window to display it. Use the iconbar menu to quit the application.

Use the mouse wheel over the image to zoom, Select-drag to pan and Adjust-click
to return to fit-to-window. The window title shows the image name and zoom.

A future build will include a proper sprite icon, directory drag-and-drop and
thumbnail browsing.
